			II. kubectl get pods
			III. kubectl describe pod nginx
			IV. kubectl get pods -o wide
					   
Conclusion

	1. Pod is the smallest unit in kubernetes structure
	2. Cluster > Node > Pod
		I.  Cluster is the set of nodes
		II. Node is the physical or virtual machine
		III. Pods are the smallest units inside the nodes.
	3. Nodes and app structure has a 1 to 1 ratio. It is this way so that node becomes a single representative unit of an architecture
